// @KeyInfo - Total Lost : 500,000+ USD
// Attacker : 0x04377cfaf4b4a44bb84042218cdda4cebcf8fd62
// Attack Contract : 0x79c5c002410a67ac7a0cde2c2217c3f560859c7e
